  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 87 * (27 * 3) * 91 * 22 * (378 * 6) \n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷, -, +, -, =, ×\n\n87 * (27 * 3) * 91 * 22 * (378 * 6) ⇒ 87 ÷ (27 - 3) + 91 - 22 = (378 × 6) \n\n⇒ 87 ÷ __**(27 - 3)**__ + 91 - 22 = __**(378 **____**×**____** 6)**__ \n\n⇒ __**87 ÷**____** 24**__ + 91 - 22 = 2268\n\n⇒ __**3.625 + 91**__ - 22 = 2268 \n\n⇒ __**94.625 - 22**__ = 2268 \n\n⇒ 72.625 ≠ 2268 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) +, -, +, ÷, ×, =\n\n87 * (27 * 3) * 91 * 22 * (378 * 6) ⇒ 87 + (27 - 3) + 91 ÷ 22 × (378 = 6) \n\n⇒ 87 + __**(27 - 3)**__ + 91 ÷ 22 × __**(378 = 6)**__ \n\n⇒ 87 + 24 + __**91 **____**÷**____** 22**__ × 378 = 6\n\n⇒ 87 + 24 + __**4.13**____** ×**____** 378**__ = 6 \n\n⇒ __**87 + 24 + 1561**__ = 6 \n\n⇒ 1672 ≠ 6 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) -, ×, =, -, -, ÷\n\n87 * (27 * 3) * 91 * 22 * (378 * 6) ⇒ 87 - (27 × 3) = 91 - 22 - (378 ÷ 6) \n\n⇒ 87 - __**(27 **____**×**____** 3)**__ = 91 - 22 - __**(378 **____**÷ 6) **__\n\n⇒ __**87 - 81**__ = __**91 - 22 - 63**__\n\n⇒ 6 = 6 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) ×, +, -, =, -, ÷\n\n87 * (27 * 3) * 91 * 22 * (378 * 6) ⇒ 87 × (27 + 3) - 91 = 22 - (378 ÷ 6) \n\n⇒ 87 × __**(27 + 3)**__ - 91 = 22 - __**(378 **____**÷ 6) **__\n\n⇒ __**87 ×**____** 30**__ - 91 = __**22 - 63**__\n\n⇒ __**2610**____** - 91**__ = -41\n\n⇒ 2519 ≠ -41 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
